+/* cellKbRead: the older name of cellKbGetData, same arguments and layout.
+ * Resistance v1.7's online lobby polls it for its chat; unresolved it
+ * returned without writing the CellKbData, so the title read whatever was
+ * in its buffer as typed keys. */
